msgid "Learning outcomes {#learning-outcomes}"
msgstr "Mga natutunan {#learning-outcomes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing this tutorial, you can expect to understand the following information:\n"
"- How the choice between blocked and interleaved ordering of the spin modes changes which fermionic modes interact, and how that\n"
"  choice appears as Pauli patterns after a flow-set fermion-to-qubit encoding.\n"
"- How to build the time-evolution circuit of the spinful Fermi-Hubbard model as a `FermionicCircuit`, and validate it against `ffsim`.\n"
"- How a flow-set synthesis keeps the two-qubit depth of a Trotter step constant as the chain grows, compared with a term-by-term `LieTrotter` synthesis.\n"
"- How to route such circuits onto the heavy-hex lattice of an IBM&reg; Heron QPU and onto the square lattice of a Nighthawk QPU,\n"
"  including the effect of fractional gates.\n"
"- Why the square lattice of Nighthawk favors blocked ordering with two ancillas while a ladder fits on the QPU, and what it\n"
"  costs to fold the ladder for larger systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos ng tutorial na ito, inaasahang maiintindihan mo ang mga sumusunod:\n"
"- Kung paano binabago ng pagpili sa pagitan ng blocked at interleaved na ordering ng mga spin mode kung aling mga fermionic mode ang nag-iinteract, at kung paano lumilitaw ang pagpiling iyon bilang mga Pauli pattern pagkatapos ng flow-set fermion-to-qubit encoding.\n"
"- Kung paano buuin ang time-evolution circuit ng spinful Fermi-Hubbard model bilang `FermionicCircuit`, at i-validate ito laban sa `ffsim`.\n"
"- Kung paano pinapanatiling pare-pareho ng flow-set synthesis ang two-qubit depth ng isang Trotter step habang humahaba ang chain, kumpara sa term-by-term na `LieTrotter` synthesis.\n"
"- Kung paano i-route ang mga ganitong circuit sa heavy-hex lattice ng IBM&reg; Heron QPU at sa square lattice ng Nighthawk QPU,\n"
"  kasama ang epekto ng fractional gates.\n"
"- Kung bakit pinapaboran ng square lattice ng Nighthawk ang blocked ordering na may dalawang ancilla habang kasya sa QPU ang isang ladder, at magkano ang gastos\n"
"  sa pagtupi ng ladder para sa mas malalaking sistema.\n"

