msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/47dd8196-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solid lines are the `{cz, rz, sx, x}` basis, and dashed lines are the fractional gate set. The two gray lines are the plain line.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga tuloy-tuloy na linya ay ang `{cz, rz, sx, x}` basis, at ang mga putol-putol na linya ay ang fractional gate set. Ang dalawang kulay-abong linya ay ang simpleng line.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The synthesis.** With `LieTrotter`, the depth grows with every site (from 47 at $L = 4$ to 599 at $L = 50$, or 12 layers per site).\n"
"The flow-set synthesis stays between 20 and 25 over the same range. The bands reach from the best to the worst of the 20 seeds.\n"
"The gate count grows linearly for both syntheses, and is lower for the flow-set synthesis (882 compared with 1032 at $L = 50$). Therefore, the lower\n"
"depth does not cost extra gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ang synthesis.** Sa `LieTrotter`, lumalaki ang depth sa bawat site (mula 47 sa $L = 4$ hanggang 599 sa $L = 50$, o 12 layer bawat site).\n"
"Ang flow-set synthesis ay nananatili sa pagitan ng 20 at 25 sa parehong saklaw. Ang mga band ay umaabot mula sa pinakamaganda hanggang sa pinakamasamang resulta sa 20 seed.\n"
"Linear ang paglaki ng gate count para sa dalawang synthesis, at mas mababa ito sa flow-set synthesis (882 kumpara sa 1032 sa $L = 50$). Kaya, ang mas mababang\n"
"depth ay hindi nangangailangan ng dagdag na gate.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The QPUs.** On both QPUs, the flow-set circuit has the same low depth as on the line. The best depth is between 20 and 25 for $L$\n"
"from 4 to 50 on Heron, on Nighthawk, and on the line. The gate counts are also similar. At $L = 10$, the circuit has 164 two-qubit gates on\n"
"Heron, 162 on Nighthawk, and 164 on the line. At $L = 50$, it has 880, 838, and 882. Therefore, **any hardware that has a long\n"
"enough path can run this circuit at an almost constant depth**. The layout is a simple search on Heron, or a snake through\n"
"the rows on Nighthawk.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ang mga QPU.** Sa parehong QPU, may kaparehong mababang depth ang flow-set circuit tulad ng sa line. Ang pinakamagandang depth ay nasa pagitan ng 20 at 25 para sa $L$\n"
"mula 4 hanggang 50 sa Heron, sa Nighthawk, at sa line. Magkakahawig din ang mga gate count. Sa $L = 10$, may 164 two-qubit gate ang circuit sa\n"
"Heron, 162 sa Nighthawk, at 164 sa line. Sa $L = 50$, may 880, 838, at 882 ito. Kaya, **anumang hardware na may sapat na habang\n"
"path ay kayang magpatakbo ng circuit na ito sa halos pare-parehong depth**. Ang layout ay simpleng paghahanap sa Heron, o isang snake sa\n"
"mga row sa Nighthawk.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Fractional gates.** The fractional gate set lowers the best depth by six layers at every size. On Heron, the depth goes from 20, 20, 23, 23,\n"
"23, 25 to 14, 14, 17, 17, 17, 19. On Nighthawk, it goes from 20, 22, 22, 22, 22, 25 to 14, 16, 16, 16, 16, 19 (at $L = 4, 10, 20, 30,\n"
"40, 50$). This result is expected. The `YY` and `ZZ` flow sets consist of `rzz` rotations, which the fractional gate set runs\n"
"as one gate, while the `cz` basis needs two `cz` gates. These rotations cause the constant drop in depth, and a drop in gate count that\n"
"increases with $L$.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Fractional gates.** Binabawasan ng fractional gate set ang pinakamagandang depth ng anim na layer sa bawat laki. Sa Heron, ang depth ay mula 20, 20, 23, 23,\n"
"23, 25 pababa sa 14, 14, 17, 17, 17, 19. Sa Nighthawk, mula 20, 22, 22, 22, 22, 25 pababa sa 14, 16, 16, 16, 16, 19 (sa $L = 4, 10, 20, 30,\n"
"40, 50$). Inaasahan ang resultang ito. Ang mga flow set na `YY` at `ZZ` ay binubuo ng mga `rzz` rotation, na pinapatakbo ng fractional gate set\n"
"bilang isang gate, habang ang `cz` basis ay nangangailangan ng dalawang `cz` gate. Ang mga rotation na ito ang sanhi ng pare-parehong pagbaba ng depth, at ng pagbaba sa gate count na\n"
"lumalaki kasabay ng $L$.\n"

