msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/25d1a8f2-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code compares the two orderings at the sizes that fit natively: interleaved on the snake, and blocked on the ladder, both on Nighthawk and in\n"
"both gate sets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inihahambing ng sumusunod na code ang dalawang ordering sa mga laki na kasya nang native: interleaved sa snake, at blocked sa ladder, parehong sa Nighthawk at sa\n"
"parehong gate set.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the blocked ladder that fits natively on the QPU ($L \\leq 10$), no gates are off a coupler.\n"
"Therefore, for these sizes, the routing step is not expected to change the circuit statistics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa blocked ladder na kasya nang native sa QPU ($L \\leq 10$), walang gate na wala sa coupler.\n"
"Kaya, para sa mga laki na ito, hindi inaasahang babaguhin ng routing step ang mga statistic ng circuit.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/b8e745c2-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/spinful-fermi-hubbard-dynamics/extracted-outputs/b8e745c2-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At the sizes that fit natively ($L \\le 10$), the blocked circuit is **about half as deep**. At $L = 10$, its depth is 10 compared with 22 in the `cz` basis, and\n"
"8 compared with 16 with fractional gates. At $L = 4$, the values are 10 compared with 20, and 8 compared with 14. The depth of the blocked circuit does not change\n"
"between $L = 4$ and $L = 10$. The blocked circuit also needs fewer gates. At $L = 10$, it needs 82 compared with 162 in the `cz` basis, and 72 compared with 116 with\n"
"fractional gates. These results are expected, because no gates are off a coupler.\n"
"Therefore, one more ancilla qubit reduces the depth by a factor of two for these sizes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa mga laki na kasya nang native ($L \\le 10$), ang blocked circuit ay **halos kalahati ng lalim**. Sa $L = 10$, ang depth nito ay 10 kumpara sa 22 sa `cz` basis, at\n"
"8 kumpara sa 16 na may fractional gates. Sa $L = 4$, ang mga halaga ay 10 kumpara sa 20, at 8 kumpara sa 14. Hindi nagbabago ang depth ng blocked circuit\n"
"sa pagitan ng $L = 4$ at $L = 10$. Mas kaunting gate din ang kailangan ng blocked circuit. Sa $L = 10$, kailangan nito ng 82 kumpara sa 162 sa `cz` basis, at 72 kumpara sa 116 na may\n"
"fractional gates. Inaasahan ang mga resultang ito, dahil walang gate na wala sa coupler.\n"
"Kaya, ang isang dagdag na ancilla qubit ay nagpapababa ng depth nang dalawang beses para sa mga laking ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At $L = 12$, this advantage ends. A chain of 13 qubits does not fit on a straight grid line, so the ladder must bend. Then six of the\n"
"98 two-qubit gates are off a coupler, and the depth of the blocked circuit increases to 25 in the `cz` basis and 23 with fractional gates. These depths are\n"
"*greater* than the interleaved depths at the same size (22 and 16). The next section examines that fold.\n"
"As before, you can also view the routed circuit of the blocked encoding for $L = 10$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa $L = 12$, nagtatapos ang bentaheng ito. Ang chain na may 13 qubit ay hindi kasya sa tuwid na grid line, kaya kailangang bumaluktot ang ladder. Pagkatapos, anim sa\n"
"98 two-qubit gate ang wala sa coupler, at tumataas ang depth ng blocked circuit sa 25 sa `cz` basis at 23 na may fractional gates. Ang mga depth na ito ay\n"
"*mas malaki* kaysa sa mga interleaved depth sa parehong laki (22 at 16). Susuriin ng susunod na seksyon ang tupi na iyon.\n"
"Tulad ng dati, maaari mo ring tingnan ang na-route na circuit ng blocked encoding para sa $L = 10$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
