# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code shows the cost of the fold. It runs the same comparison as before, up to 50 sites, and adds blocked order on Heron.\n"
"The heavy-hex lattice has no ladder, so on Heron the router chooses the layout. This comparison is the final comparison of all four\n"
"variants, with the depth on the left and the two-qubit gate count on the right.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng sumusunod na code ang gastos ng tupi. Pinapatakbo nito ang parehong paghahambing tulad ng dati, hanggang 50 site, at idinaragdag ang blocked order sa Heron.\n"
"Walang ladder ang heavy-hex lattice, kaya sa Heron ang router ang pumipili ng layout. Ang paghahambing na ito ay ang huling paghahambing ng lahat ng apat na\n"
"variant, na may depth sa kaliwa at two-qubit gate count sa kanan.\n"

